      A*
      A* <Synopsis>
      A* Minimal DSPF with one record format, aliases, and attribute fields.
      A* </Synopsis>
      A*
      A* <Revision History>
      A* Revisioner | Date | Jira No (if known) | Change |
      A* R. Strauss | 2026-08-28 | N/A | Initial scaffold |
      A* </Revision History>
      A                                      DSPSIZ(24 80 *DS3)
      A                                      PRINT
      A          R RECORD_NAME
      A                                  2 20'Workflow Management System'
      A                                  4  2'Customer:'
      A            CUSTNO         7Y 0B  4 12EDTCDE(Z)
      A                                      ALIAS(CUSTOMER_NUMBER)
      A                                      DSPATR(&CUSTNOA)
      A                                  6  2'Name:'
      A            CUSTNAM       30A  O  6 12
      A                                      ALIAS(CUSTOMER_NAME)
      A                                      DSPATR(&CUSTNAMA)
      A                                  8  2'Status:'
      A            STATUS        10A  O  8 12
      A                                      ALIAS(CUSTOMER_STATUS)
      A                                      DSPATR(&STATUSA)
      A            CUSTNOA        1A  P
      A                                      ALIAS(CUSTOMER_NUMBER_ATTR)
      A            CUSTNAMA       1A  P
      A                                      ALIAS(CUSTOMER_NAME_ATTR)
      A            STATUSA        1A  P
      A                                      ALIAS(CUSTOMER_STATUS_ATTR)
      A          CF03(03 'Exit')
      A          CF05(05 'Refresh')
